  unitName: Emberheart Vyrr
  unitId: 810998
  unitNumber: 8652
  description: "Vyrr considered herself rather lenient, refraining from ripping her
    \"opponent\" to shreds over his feeble insult. The self-styled hero was nevertheless
    quivering in his boots, and was barely holding on to the brand-new sword he probably
    believes is legendary. As her impressive frame cast an imposing shadow over her
    trembling adversary, his eyes widened even more when she told him\u2014in no
    uncertain terms\u2014to leave.\"Wait, you're letting me...go?\"Vyrr sighed. Her
    kin could have at least *tried* to leave a better impression. It was well-known
    that dragons are proud and terribly dangerous creatures. Many preferred solitude,
    but some insisted on toying with humans, whether it's snatching maidens or commandeering
    a castle (both of which are ill-advised). As a result, dragon slayers have risen
    to fame dispatching the more notorious ones. Even Vyrr had to agree some had
    it coming, but it didn't help having their entire race condemned.As for Vyrr,
    she was more interested in the magical curiosities humans come up with. Showing
    up at a mage tower as an enormous red dragon, however, was bound to evoke hysterical
    screaming. So she learned to conceal herself...somewhat. Vanity dictated she
    would retain her draconic traits, but in time, she came to boast among her visitors
    a number of learned eccentrics.Still, a dragon was a dragon, and as winter approached,
    Vyrr felt the need to hibernate. Tired and sleepy, Vyrr shooed the confused hero
    out of her cavern, and settled down for another long sleep. The blizzard was
    oddly harsh this year, but it was nothing her inner flame couldn't keep warm.After
    all, who else would be foolish enough to wake a sleeping dragon?"
  summonDesc: How did you get in here?<br>I'm in a good mood, so run along.<br>...You
    want me to...join you?
  fusionDesc: "What is this?<br>I've no use for\u2014<br>Oh. That's...quite shiny,
    yes."
  evoDesc: Hmph. As if it wasn't abundantly clear I'm a *dragon*.
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
